1. Remove lines 23-25: delete ANTHROPIC_API_URL, ANTHROPIC_API_KEY, CLAUDE_MODEL constants.
2. Add import at top (after existing imports): import { routeCall } from '../../scripts/lib/clawrouter-v2';
