5. The JSON parsing block (lines 185-199) stays IDENTICAL — parse result.content the same way.
6. The InsightBrief construction block (lines 201-215) stays IDENTICAL.
Do NOT rewrite the whole file. Only the 3 changes above: remove 3 consts, add 1 import, replace fetch() block.
